L["Default: "] = "默认："
L["Core rotation abilities used every fight — your most important cooldowns."] = "每场战斗都会用到的核心循环技能——你最重要的冷却技能。"
L["Throughput cooldowns, maintenance buffs, and situational damage or healing abilities."] = "输出爆发技能、维持类增益，以及情境性的伤害或治疗技能。"
