L["Enabled"] = "启用"
L["Enables or disables this row. When disabled, abilities assigned to this row are hidden and the row takes no space on the HUD."] = "启用或禁用此行。禁用后，分配到此行的技能将被隐藏，且该行不占用 HUD 空间。"
L["Size"] = "大小"
L["Icon Size"] = "图标大小"
L["The size of each ability icon in this row, in pixels. Each row can have different-sized icons — for example, larger icons for your main rotation and smaller ones for utility."] = "此行中每个技能图标的大小（像素）。每行可以使用不同大小的图标——例如，主循环使用较大的图标，辅助技能使用较小的图标。"
L["Max Icons"] = "最大图标数"
L["The maximum number of ability icons that can appear in this row. If you assign more spells than this limit, the extra ones won't be shown."] = "此行中可显示的最大技能图标数。如果你分配的法术超过此上限，多余的将不会显示。"
L["Aspect Ratio"] = "宽高比"
L["Override the icon shape for this row. |cffffffffInherit|r uses the global setting from Appearance."] = "覆盖此行的图标形状。|cffffffff继承|r 使用“外观”中的全局设置。"
L["Inherit"] = "继承"
L["Square (1:1)"] = "正方形 (1:1)"
L["Slightly Compact"] = "略微紧凑"
L["Compact (4:3)"] = "紧凑 (4:3)"
L["Very Compact"] = "非常紧凑"
L["Ultra Compact (2:1)"] = "超级紧凑 (2:1)"
L["Flow Layout"] = "流式布局"
L["Wraps icons into multiple lines instead of displaying them all in a single long line. The Icons Per Row setting controls the maximum icons per line.\n\nTo avoid a sparse last row, icons are moved down from the previous row — for example, 8 icons at 6 per row becomes 5 and 3 instead of 6 and 2."] = "将图标换行排列为多行，而不是全部显示在一条长行中。“每行图标数”设置控制每行的最大图标数。\n\n为避免最后一行过于稀疏，图标会从上一行下移——例如，8 个图标每行 6 个时会变为 5 和 3，而非 6 和 2。"
L["Icons Per Row"] = "每行图标数"
L["The maximum number of icons on each line before wrapping to the next. Rows fill from the top, so earlier rows are always full.\n\nTo avoid a sparse last row, icons are moved down from the previous row — for example, 14 icons at 6 per row becomes 6, 5, 3 instead of 6, 6, 2."] = "换到下一行之前每行的最大图标数。图标从顶部开始填充，因此靠前的行始终是满的。\n\n为避免最后一行过于稀疏，图标会从上一行下移——例如，14 个图标每行 6 个时会变为 6、5、3，而非 6、6、2。"
L["Reorder the vertical layout of the HUD and adjust spacing between elements."] = "重新排列 HUD 的垂直布局，并调整各元素之间的间距。"
L["Up"] = "上移"
L["Down"] = "下移"
L["Gap above %s"] = "%s 上方的间距"
L["Pixels of space between %s and %s."] = "%s 与 %s 之间的间距（像素）。"
L["VeevHUD"] = "VeevHUD"
L["Version "] = "版本 "
L["General"] = "常规"
L["Global settings that affect the entire HUD. Individual modules have their own tabs."] = "影响整个 HUD 的全局设置。各个模块有自己的选项卡。"
L["Position and Scale"] = "位置与缩放"
L["Horizontal Offset"] = "水平偏移"
L["Moves the entire HUD left or right from the center of the screen. Negative values shift it left, positive values shift it right. The range adjusts to your screen resolution."] = "将整个 HUD 从屏幕中心向左或向右移动。负值向左偏移，正值向右偏移。范围会根据你的屏幕分辨率进行调整。"
L["Vertical Offset"] = "垂直偏移"
L["Moves the entire HUD up or down on your screen. Negative values move it below center, positive values move it above. The range adjusts to your screen resolution."] = "在屏幕上将整个 HUD 上下移动。负值移到中心下方，正值移到中心上方。范围会根据你的屏幕分辨率进行调整。"
L["Scale"] = "缩放"
L["Makes everything in the HUD bigger or smaller. 100% is the normal size. Increase if you have trouble seeing the icons, decrease if they take up too much screen space."] = "使 HUD 中的所有内容变大或变小。100% 为正常大小。如果看不清图标，可调大；如果占用屏幕空间过多，可调小。"
L["Appearance"] = "外观"
L["Font"] = "字体"
L["The font used for all text in the HUD, including cooldown timers, stack counts, health/resource values, and proc durations.\n\nIf you have font-sharing addons installed (SharedMedia, etc.), their fonts will appear here automatically."] = "HUD 中所有文本使用的字体，包括冷却计时、叠加层数、生命值/资源数值以及触发持续时间。\n\n如果你安装了字体共享插件（SharedMedia 等），它们的字体会自动显示在此处。"
L["Text Color"] = "文本颜色"
L["The color used for cooldown countdowns, duration timers, and stack counts across all HUD elements."] = "用于所有 HUD 元素的冷却倒计时、持续时间计时和叠加层数的颜色。"
L["Text Outline"] = "文本描边"
L["Controls how text is rendered across all HUD elements.\n\n|cffffffffOutline|r — Font outline only.\n|cffffffffShadow|r — Drop shadow only (cleaner at small sizes).\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Font outline + drop shadow (maximum readability).\n|cffffffffNone|r — No outline or shadow.\n\nIndividual elements can override this in their own settings."] = "控制所有 HUD 元素中文本的渲染方式。\n\n|cffffffff描边|r —— 仅字体描边。\n|cffffffff阴影|r —— 仅投影（小尺寸下更清晰）。\n|cffffffff两者|r —— 字体描边 + 投影（可读性最佳）。\n|cffffffff无|r —— 无描边或阴影。\n\n各个元素可在其自身设置中覆盖此项。"
L["Bar Texture"] = "状态条材质"
L["The texture used for all status bars in the HUD, including health, resource, combo point, and energy ticker bars.\n\nIf you have texture-sharing addons installed (SharedMedia, etc.), their textures will appear here automatically."] = "HUD 中所有状态条使用的材质，包括生命值、资源、连击点和能量计时条。\n\n如果你安装了材质共享插件（SharedMedia 等），它们的材质会自动显示在此处。"
L["Bar Gradient"] = "状态条渐变"
L["Adds a subtle dark-to-light gradient across all status bars (health, resource, combo points, and energy ticker), giving them more visual depth instead of a flat solid color."] = "为所有状态条（生命值、资源、连击点和能量计时条）添加柔和的由暗到亮渐变，使其更具视觉层次感，而非纯色平面。"
L["Icon Zoom"] = "图标缩放"
L["Zooms into each icon's artwork, cropping the edges. Affects ability rows and Aura Tracker. Useful for removing the default border that some spell textures have. 0% shows the full icon, 16% is a subtle crop."] = "放大每个图标的图案，裁剪边缘。影响技能行和光环追踪器。可用于去除某些法术材质自带的默认边框。0% 显示完整图标，16% 为轻微裁剪。"
L["Sound"] = "声音"
L["Sound Channel"] = "声音通道"
L["Audio channel for all VeevHUD sound alerts.\n\n|cffffffffMaster|r — Always plays regardless of volume sliders.\n|cffffffffSound Effects|r — Respects the Sound Effects volume slider.\n|cffffffffMusic|r — Respects the Music volume slider.\n|cffffffffAmbience|r — Respects the Ambience volume slider."] = "所有 VeevHUD 声音提示的音频通道。\n\n|cffffffff主音量|r —— 始终播放，不受音量滑块影响。\n|cffffffff音效|r —— 遵循“音效”音量滑块。\n|cffffffff音乐|r —— 遵循“音乐”音量滑块。\n|cffffffff环境|r —— 遵循“环境”音量滑块。"
L["Register Sound Kit ID"] = "注册声音组 ID"
L["Enter a WoW Sound Kit ID (a number) to register it as an available sound. Once registered, it appears in all sound dropdowns.\n\nBrowse IDs at: wowhead.com/sounds\n\nExamples: 8959 (raid warning), 11466 (Illidan), 8174 (PvP flag).\n\nNote: the speaker preview button in dropdowns does not work for Kit IDs, but the sound plays correctly in-game."] = "输入魔兽世界的声音组 ID（一个数字）以将其注册为可用声音。注册后，它会出现在所有声音下拉菜单中。\n\n在以下网址浏览 ID：wowhead.com/sounds\n\n示例：8959（团队警报）、11466（伊利丹）、8174（PvP 旗帜）。\n\n注意：下拉菜单中的扬声器预览按钮对声音组 ID 无效，但声音在游戏中会正常播放。"
L["Invalid Sound Kit ID: %s"] = "无效的声音组 ID：%s"
L["Playing Kit ID %s — registered as %s (top of sound dropdowns)."] = "正在播放声音组 ID %s——已注册为 %s（位于声音下拉菜单顶部）。"
L["Sound Kit ID registration failed — LibSharedMedia not available."] = "声音组 ID 注册失败——LibSharedMedia 不可用。"
L["Visibility"] = "可见性"
L["Out of Combat Opacity"] = "脱离战斗不透明度"
L["Controls the HUD's visibility when not in combat. Use this to fade the HUD when out of combat so it's less distracting. 100% = fully visible, 50% = half transparent, 0% = invisible.\n\nNote: This setting is ignored while the config panel is open so you can see the HUD while configuring."] = "控制脱离战斗时 HUD 的可见性。可用于在脱离战斗时淡化 HUD，以减少干扰。100% = 完全可见，50% = 半透明，0% = 不可见。\n\n注意：打开配置面板时会忽略此设置，以便你在配置时能看到 HUD。"
L["Hide on Flight Path"] = "在飞行路线上隐藏"
L["Automatically hides the HUD when you're on a flight path (taxi). The HUD will reappear when you land. Useful to keep your screen clean while traveling.\n\nNote: This setting is ignored while the config panel is open so you can see the HUD while configuring."] = "当你处于飞行路线（出租坐骑）上时自动隐藏 HUD。落地后 HUD 会重新出现。可在旅行时保持屏幕整洁。\n\n注意：打开配置面板时会忽略此设置，以便你在配置时能看到 HUD。"
L["Animations"] = "动画"
L["Smooth Bar Animation"] = "平滑状态条动画"
L["Health bars, resource bars, and the resource-cost overlay on ability icons animate smoothly instead of jumping when values change."] = "生命值条、资源条以及技能图标上的资源消耗覆盖层在数值变化时平滑过渡，而非跳变。"
L["Smooth Dim Transition"] = "平滑变暗过渡"
L["When icons fade in or out (e.g., dimming on cooldown), the transition is gradual instead of instant. Disable for snappier visual feedback."] = "当图标淡入或淡出时（例如冷却时变暗），过渡是渐进的而非瞬时的。禁用可获得更明快的视觉反馈。"
L["Ability Rows"] = "技能行"
L["Default visual settings for all ability rows. Individual rows can override icon shape in their own tabs."] = "所有技能行的默认视觉设置。各个行可在其自身选项卡中覆盖图标形状。"
L["Tip: Install the Masque addon to reskin ability icons with custom button styles."] = "提示：安装 Masque 插件可用自定义按钮样式为技能图标重新换肤。"
L["Shape"] = "形状"
L["Default icon shape for all ability rows. Individual rows can override this in their own settings. Aura Tracker has its own setting under Bars."] = "所有技能行的默认图标形状。各个行可在其自身设置中覆盖此项。光环追踪器在“条”下有自己的设置。"
L["Spacing"] = "间距"
L["Icon Spacing"] = "图标间距"
L["The horizontal gap in pixels between each ability icon within a row. A small gap (2-4) helps visually separate icons. Set to 0 for icons to touch. Negative values allow overlap, which may look better with certain skins."] = "一行内每个技能图标之间的水平间距（像素）。较小的间距（2-4）有助于在视觉上区分图标。设为 0 则图标相接。负值允许重叠，在某些皮肤下可能更美观。"
L["Flow Row Spacing"] = "流式行间距"
L["When a row uses flow layout and icons overflow to a second line, this is the vertical gap between lines."] = "当一行使用流式布局且图标溢出到第二行时，这是各行之间的垂直间距。"
L["Opacity"] = "不透明度"
L["Ready Opacity"] = "就绪不透明度"
L["How visible icons are when the ability is ready to use. 100% means fully visible, lower values make ready abilities slightly transparent. Most people want this at 100%."] = "技能就绪可用时图标的可见程度。100% 表示完全可见，较低的值会使就绪技能略微透明。大多数人会将其设为 100%。"
L["Cooldown Opacity"] = "冷却不透明度"
L["How visible icons are when on cooldown (for rows with Dim On Cooldown enabled). A lower value (like 30%) makes cooldown abilities fade out so you can focus on what's ready. Higher values keep them visible."] = "技能处于冷却时图标的可见程度（适用于启用了“冷却时变暗”的行）。较低的值（如 30%）会使冷却中的技能淡出，让你专注于已就绪的技能。较高的值则保持其可见。"
L["Grey Out Unusable"] = "不可用时变灰"
L["Makes icons grey when you don't have enough mana, rage, or energy to use the ability, or when you're in the wrong stance. Works the same way as WoW's default action bars.\n\nAutomatically disabled while resting in an inn or city to avoid constant grey-outs on combat abilities."] = "当你没有足够的法力、怒气或能量来使用技能，或处于错误的姿态时，使图标变灰。其工作方式与魔兽世界的默认动作条相同。\n\n在旅馆或城市中休息时会自动禁用，以避免战斗技能持续变灰。"
L["Cooldowns"] = "冷却时间"
L["How cooldown information is displayed on ability icons."] = "冷却信息在技能图标上的显示方式。"
L["Display"] = "显示"
L["Cooldown Text"] = "冷却文本"
L["Displays the remaining cooldown time as numbers on top of each icon. When enabled, VeevHUD shows its own text and hides text from addons like OmniCC. Select which rows display cooldown text."] = "在每个图标上以数字形式显示剩余冷却时间。启用后，VeevHUD 会显示自己的文本并隐藏 OmniCC 等插件的文本。选择哪些行显示冷却文本。"
L["Text outline style for ability icon text (cooldowns, stacks, charges, keybinds)."] = "技能图标文本（冷却、叠加、充能、按键绑定）的文本描边样式。"
L["Minutes Threshold"] = "分钟阈值"
L["Remaining times above this many minutes are shown compactly. At the default of 2, 3 minutes 27 seconds is shown as 3m, while 1 minute 45 seconds is shown as 1:45."] = "超过此分钟数的剩余时间将以紧凑形式显示。在默认值 2 时，3 分 27 秒显示为 3m，而 1 分 45 秒显示为 1:45。"
L["Decimal Threshold"] = "小数阈值"
L["Remaining times below this many seconds are shown with one decimal. At the default of 2, 3.4 seconds is shown as 3, while 1.8 seconds is shown as 1.8."] = "低于此秒数的剩余时间将显示一位小数。在默认值 2 时，3.4 秒显示为 3，而 1.8 秒显示为 1.8。"
L["Cooldown Spiral"] = "冷却旋转"
L["Shows the dark 'clock sweep' overlay on abilities that are on cooldown. This visual helps you see at a glance how much time remains. Select which rows display the cooldown spiral."] = "在处于冷却的技能上显示深色的“时钟扫描”覆盖层。这一视觉效果可帮助你一眼看出还剩多少时间。选择哪些行显示冷却旋转。"
L["Show GCD"] = "显示公共冷却"
L["Controls which rows display the Global Cooldown (GCD) spinner. The GCD is the brief ~1.5 second lockout after using most abilities. Showing GCD helps you see when you can press your next ability."] = "控制哪些行显示公共冷却时间（GCD）转盘。GCD 是使用大多数技能后约 1.5 秒的短暂锁定。显示 GCD 可帮助你判断何时可以按下一个技能。"
L["Behavior"] = "行为"
L["Dim On Cooldown"] = "冷却时变暗"
L["Controls which rows fade out (become transparent) when abilities are on cooldown. The amount they fade is controlled by the |cffffffffCooldown Opacity|r setting.\n\nRows without dimming stay at full brightness and use greying-out to indicate unavailability instead. Many players keep the Primary row undimmed so their core rotation stays visually prominent."] = "控制哪些行在技能处于冷却时淡出（变透明）。淡出的程度由 |cffffffff冷却不透明度|r 设置控制。\n\n不变暗的行保持全亮度，转而使用变灰来表示不可用。许多玩家让主要行不变暗，以使其核心循环在视觉上保持突出。"
L["Cooldown Sparkle"] = "冷却闪光"
L["Plays WoW's native sparkle animation when a cooldown finishes. Also triggers after the GCD, matching default action bar behavior. This is purely cooldown-based — it does not check resources or other usability conditions."] = "冷却结束时播放魔兽世界原生的闪光动画。也会在 GCD 之后触发，与默认动作条行为一致。这完全基于冷却——不会检查资源或其他可用性条件。"
L["Cooldown Spiral Opacity"] = "冷却旋转不透明度"
L["How dark the spiral overlay appears during ability cooldowns. Lower values make it more subtle and transparent.\n\nNote: Even at 100%, the spiral won't completely obscure the icon — WoW's cooldown texture has built-in transparency."] = "技能冷却期间旋转覆盖层的深暗程度。较低的值会使其更柔和、更透明。\n\n注意：即使在 100% 时，旋转也不会完全遮挡图标——魔兽世界的冷却材质自带透明度。"
L["Resources"] = "资源"
L["How resource costs (mana, rage, energy) are shown on ability icons."] = "资源消耗（法力、怒气、能量）在技能图标上的显示方式。"
L["Display Mode"] = "显示模式"
L["How ability icons show whether you can afford to cast them:\n\n|cffffffffPrediction|r — Extends the cooldown sweep to include resource regeneration time. The icon shows how long until you can actually cast, accounting for both cooldown and resource cost. Energy and Mana predictions are tick-aware and very accurate. Rage falls back to Fill since rage income is unpredictable.\n\n|cffffffffFill|r — Darkens the icon from top to bottom proportional to missing resources. Simple and easy to read.\n\n|cffffffffBar|r — Shows a small colored bar at the bottom of each icon that fills up as you gain resources."] = "技能图标显示你是否有足够资源施放它们的方式：\n\n|cffffffff预测|r —— 延长冷却扫描以包含资源恢复时间。图标显示距离你真正能施放还有多久，同时考虑冷却和资源消耗。能量和法力的预测会感知跳动周期，非常精确。怒气则回退为“填充”，因为怒气获取难以预测。\n\n|cffffffff填充|r —— 按缺失资源的比例从上到下使图标变暗。简单易读。\n\n|cffffffff条|r —— 在每个图标底部显示一条彩色小条，随着你获得资源而填满。"
L["Show On Rows"] = "在以下行显示"
L["Choose which rows show resource cost information on their icons. When enabled, you can see at a glance whether you have enough mana, rage, or energy to cast each ability."] = "选择哪些行在其图标上显示资源消耗信息。启用后，你可以一眼看出是否有足够的法力、怒气或能量来施放每个技能。"
L["Show During Cooldowns"] = "冷却期间显示"
L["Shows the resource cost overlay on icons while they are on cooldown, so you can see your resource state through the cooldown spiral. When disabled, the resource overlay only appears when the ability is off cooldown."] = "在图标处于冷却期间显示资源消耗覆盖层，以便你透过冷却旋转看到自己的资源状态。禁用后，资源覆盖层仅在技能脱离冷却时出现。"
L["Fill Style"] = "填充样式"
L["Use Resource Color"] = "使用资源颜色"
L["Uses your resource type color for the fill overlay — red for rage, blue for mana, yellow for energy — instead of the custom Fill Color."] = "为填充覆盖层使用你的资源类型颜色——怒气为红色、法力为蓝色、能量为黄色——而非自定义的填充颜色。"
L["Fill Color"] = "填充颜色"
L["The color of the resource cost fill overlay on icons. Default is black (a dark overlay showing missing resources). Only used when Use Resource Color is unchecked."] = "图标上资源消耗填充覆盖层的颜色。默认为黑色（显示缺失资源的深色覆盖层）。仅在未勾选“使用资源颜色”时生效。"
L["Fill Opacity"] = "填充不透明度"
L["How opaque the resource cost overlay appears on icons. Higher values make it more obvious when you can't afford an ability. Applies to Fill mode and Prediction mode's fill fallback (used for rage and when predictions are unavailable)."] = "图标上资源消耗覆盖层的不透明程度。较高的值会让你在无法负担某技能时更明显地看出。适用于“填充”模式以及“预测”模式的填充回退（用于怒气以及预测不可用时）。"
L["Invert Fill"] = "反转填充"
L["Inverts the fill direction. Normal: overlay covers from top down showing missing resources. Inverted: overlay fills from bottom up showing current resources."] = "反转填充方向。正常：覆盖层从上往下覆盖，显示缺失资源。反转：覆盖层从下往上填充，显示当前资源。"
L["Bar Style"] = "条样式"
L["Uses your resource type color for the bar — red for rage, blue for mana, yellow for energy — instead of the custom Bar Color."] = "为条使用你的资源类型颜色——怒气为红色、法力为蓝色、能量为黄色——而非自定义的条颜色。"
L["Bar Color"] = "条颜色"
L["The color of the resource bar at the bottom of icons. Only used when Use Resource Color is unchecked."] = "图标底部资源条的颜色。仅在未勾选“使用资源颜色”时生效。"
L["Bar Height"] = "条高度"
L["Height of the small resource bar shown at the bottom of each icon. Only visible when Display Mode is set to |cffffffffBar|r."] = "每个图标底部显示的资源小条的高度。仅当显示模式设为 |cffffffff条|r 时可见。"
L["Effects"] = "效果"
L["Visual effects on ability icons for active buffs, debuffs, and procs."] = "技能图标上针对生效的增益、减益和触发效果的视觉效果。"
L["Aura Tracking"] = "光环追踪"
L["Abilities that apply buffs or debuffs (like Intimidating Shout, Rend, Renew) show the active duration with a glow while the effect is on a target. After it expires, the cooldown is shown. Disable if you only want to see cooldowns."] = "施加增益或减益的技能（如恐吓咆哮、撕裂、恢复）在效果作用于目标时会以辉光显示生效持续时间。效果结束后则显示冷却。如果你只想看冷却，可禁用此项。"
L["Target-of-Target Support"] = "目标的目标支持"
L["Also check for your buffs and debuffs on your target's target. Useful for healers tracking HoTs on the tank's target.\n\nExamples:\n- Target the boss, see your heals on the tank (the boss's target)\n- Target the tank, see your DoTs on the boss (the tank's target)"] = "同时检查你的目标的目标身上是否有你的增益和减益。对于追踪坦克目标身上持续治疗的治疗者很有用。\n\n示例：\n- 选定首领，查看坦克（首领的目标）身上你的治疗\n- 选定坦克，查看首领（坦克的目标）身上你的持续伤害"
L["Aura Spiral Opacity"] = "光环旋转不透明度"
L["How dark the spiral overlay appears when tracking active buff or aura durations on icons. Lower values make it more subtle and transparent.\n\nNote: Even at 100%, the spiral won't completely obscure the icon — WoW's cooldown texture has built-in transparency."] = "在图标上追踪生效的增益或光环持续时间时旋转覆盖层的深暗程度。较低的值会使其更柔和、更透明。\n\n注意：即使在 100% 时，旋转也不会完全遮挡图标——魔兽世界的冷却材质自带透明度。"
L["Cast Feedback"] = "施法反馈"
L["Plays a brief 'pop' animation (the icon scales up slightly then back down) whenever you successfully cast an ability. Gives satisfying visual feedback that your spell went off. Select which rows show this animation."] = "每当你成功施放一个技能时播放短暂的“弹跳”动画（图标略微放大后缩回）。提供令人满意的视觉反馈，表明你的法术已施放。选择哪些行显示此动画。"
L["Pop Scale"] = "弹跳缩放"
L["How much the icon briefly grows when you cast a spell. Higher values = bigger pop."] = "施法时图标短暂放大的幅度。值越高，弹跳越大。"
L["Ready Glow"] = "就绪辉光"
L["Shows a glowing border around ability icons when they come off cooldown and are ready to use. Only triggers while in combat. Select which rows display this effect."] = "当技能脱离冷却并就绪可用时，在技能图标周围显示发光边框。仅在战斗中触发。选择哪些行显示此效果。"
L["Re-trigger Glow"] = "重新触发辉光"
L["Which rows re-trigger the glow whenever an ability becomes usable again (not just the first time).\n\nOn these rows, the glow plays again every time usability changes (e.g., gaining enough resources, target entering Execute range). Rows not selected here play the glow only once per cooldown cycle.\n\nNote: Reactive abilities (like Execute or Overpower) always re-trigger regardless of this setting."] = "哪些行在技能再次可用时重新触发辉光（而不仅是第一次）。\n\n在这些行上，每当可用性发生变化（例如获得足够资源、目标进入斩杀范围）时辉光都会再次播放。未在此处选中的行，每个冷却周期仅播放一次辉光。\n\n注意：反应型技能（如斩杀或压制）无论此设置如何始终会重新触发。"
L["Duration"] = "持续时间"
L["How long each ready glow animation lasts (in seconds). After this time, the glow fades out. On rows with Re-trigger Glow, the glow will re-trigger at this interval each time usability changes."] = "每次就绪辉光动画持续多久（秒）。超过此时间后，辉光会淡出。在启用了“重新触发辉光”的行上，每次可用性变化时辉光都会按此间隔重新触发。"
L["Pre-trigger Time"] = "提前触发时间"
L["Begin the glow this many seconds before the cooldown completes, so you can prepare your next action. At 0, the glow only appears once the cooldown is fully complete."] = "在冷却结束前提前这么多秒开始辉光，以便你准备下一个动作。设为 0 时，辉光仅在冷却完全结束后出现。"
L["Queued Highlight"] = "排队高亮"
L["Brightens the icon of your next queued ability. Most noticeable on \"next melee\" attacks like Heroic Strike or Maul that stay queued until your next swing, but you may also see a brief flash on any ability queued during a cast or GCD."] = "提亮你下一个排队技能的图标。在像英勇打击或槌击这类“下次近战”攻击（会一直排队到你下次挥击）上最为明显，但你也可能在施法或 GCD 期间排队的任何技能上看到短暂闪烁。"
L["Indicators"] = "指示器"
L["Range checking, sorting, and keybind display on ability icons."] = "技能图标上的距离检测、排序和按键绑定显示。"
L["Range Indicator"] = "距离指示器"
L["Shows a red overlay on spell icons when your current target is out of range. Shows when an ability is usable but out of range — even during cooldown, giving you a heads-up on positioning. When resources are insufficient, the grey/resource indicators take priority instead.\n\nNote: Only shows when you have a target. Spells without a range component (self-buffs, etc.) are not affected."] = "当你当前的目标超出距离时，在法术图标上显示红色覆盖层。在技能可用但超出距离时显示——即使在冷却期间，也能提前提醒你注意走位。当资源不足时，则优先显示变灰/资源指示器。\n\n注意：仅在你有目标时显示。无距离限制的法术（自身增益等）不受影响。"
L["Dynamic Sorting"] = "动态排序"
L["Automatically reorders icons left-to-right by remaining cooldown, so abilities that are almost ready appear first.\n\nUseful for DOT classes (see which debuff is closest to expiring) and cooldown-heavy classes (see which ability is ready next).\n\nTie-breaker: When multiple abilities are ready, they sort by their original row position — so your row order acts as a priority list and the leftmost icon is always the next best spell to cast."] = "按剩余冷却时间从左到右自动重新排列图标，使即将就绪的技能排在前面。\n\n对持续伤害职业（查看哪个减益最接近结束）和冷却密集型职业（查看下一个就绪的技能）很有用。\n\n平局处理：当多个技能就绪时，它们按原始行位置排序——因此你的行顺序就是一个优先级列表，最左侧的图标始终是下一个最值得施放的法术。"
L["Smooth Sorting"] = "平滑排序"
L["Icons slide smoothly into their new position when the sort order changes. Disable for instant repositioning."] = "当排序顺序变化时，图标平滑滑入新位置。禁用可瞬时重新定位。"
L["Keybinds"] = "按键绑定"
L["Displays the keyboard shortcut for each ability in the bottom-right corner. VeevHUD scans your action bars to find where each spell is placed. Modifiers are abbreviated: Shift=S, Ctrl=C, Alt=A (e.g., Shift+X becomes 'SX').\n\nSupports Bartender4, ElvUI, Dominos. If you move spells or change keybinds, the display updates automatically."] = "在右下角显示每个技能的键盘快捷键。VeevHUD 会扫描你的动作条以找出每个法术的位置。修饰键以缩写表示：Shift=S、Ctrl=C、Alt=A（例如 Shift+X 显示为“SX”）。\n\n支持 Bartender4、ElvUI、Dominos。如果你移动法术或更改按键绑定，显示会自动更新。"
L["Text Size"] = "文本大小"
L["The font size for keybind text in pixels. Larger values make the text more readable but take up more space on the icon."] = "按键绑定文本的字号（像素）。值越大文本越易读，但在图标上占用的空间也越多。"
L["Item Counts"] = "物品数量"
L["Reagent Count"] = "材料数量"
L["Shows the number of reagents you have in the top-right corner of spell icons that consume reagents on cast. Examples: Soul Shards on warlock abilities, seeds on Rebirth, Flash Powder on Vanish, Ankhs on Reincarnation."] = "在施法时消耗材料的法术图标右上角显示你拥有的材料数量。示例：术士技能的灵魂碎片、复生的种子、消失的闪光粉、复活术的安卡。"
L["Count All Ranks"] = "统计所有等级"
L["When enabled, counts reagents for all spell ranks combined (e.g., all seed types for Rebirth). When disabled, only counts the reagent for your highest learned rank."] = "启用后，合并统计所有法术等级的材料（例如复生的所有种子类型）。禁用后，仅统计你已学最高等级所需的材料。"
L["Consumable Count"] = "消耗品数量"
L["Shows your current bag count in the top-right corner of consumable icons (potions, runes, etc.)."] = "在消耗品图标（药水、符文等）的右上角显示你当前的背包数量。"
L["Status Bars"] = "状态条"
L["Resource Bar"] = "资源条"
L["Your character's resource bar (mana, rage, or energy)."] = "你角色的资源条（法力、怒气或能量）。"
L["Shows a bar displaying your current mana, rage, or energy (depending on your class). Appears between the health bar and the ability icon rows."] = "显示一条状态条，展示你当前的法力、怒气或能量（取决于你的职业）。出现在生命值条与技能图标行之间。"
L["Width"] = "宽度"
L["How wide the resource bar is in pixels."] = "资源条的宽度（像素）。"
L["Height"] = "高度"
L["How tall/thick the resource bar is in pixels. Changing this will automatically adjust the position of elements above it."] = "资源条的高度/厚度（像素）。更改此项会自动调整其上方元素的位置。"
L["Text"] = "文本"
L["Text Format"] = "文本格式"
L["Controls what text is shown on the resource bar.\n\n|cffffffffCurrent|r — Shows your actual resource (e.g., 4523).\n|cffffffffPercent|r — Shows your resource percentage (e.g., 85%).\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Shows both (e.g., 4523 (85%)).\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max|r — Shows current and maximum (e.g., 4523 / 5320).\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max (%)|r — Shows current, maximum, and percentage (e.g., 4523 / 5320 (85%)).\n|cffffffffDeficit|r — Shows how much is missing (e.g., -797). Hidden at full.\n|cffffffffNone|r — Hides the text entirely."] = "控制资源条上显示的文本。\n\n|cffffffff当前值|r —— 显示你的实际资源（例如 4523）。\n|cffffffff百分比|r —— 显示你的资源百分比（例如 85%）。\n|cffffffff两者|r —— 同时显示（例如 4523 (85%)）。\n|cffffffff当前值 / 最大值|r —— 显示当前值和最大值（例如 4523 / 5320）。\n|cffffffff当前值 / 最大值 (%)|r —— 显示当前值、最大值和百分比（例如 4523 / 5320 (85%)）。\n|cffffffff缺口|r —— 显示缺失的数量（例如 -797）。满值时隐藏。\n|cffffffff无|r —— 完全隐藏文本。"
L["Number Format"] = "数字格式"
L["Controls how numbers are displayed.\n\n|cffffffffAbbreviated|r — Large numbers shortened (e.g., 4.5k, 1.2m).\n|cffffffffFull|r — Whole numbers (e.g., 4523).\n|cffffffffComma|r — Comma-separated (e.g., 4,523)."] = "控制数字的显示方式。\n\n|cffffffff缩写|r —— 大数字简化（例如 4.5k、1.2m）。\n|cffffffff完整|r —— 完整数字（例如 4523）。\n|cffffffff逗号|r —— 逗号分隔（例如 4,523）。"
L["Font size for the resource text. Larger sizes are easier to read but may overflow small bars."] = "资源文本的字号。较大的字号更易读，但在小条上可能溢出。"
L["Text outline style for the resource bar."] = "资源条的文本描边样式。"
L["Default Color"] = "默认颜色"
L["Colors the bar based on your resource type — blue for mana, red for rage, yellow for energy. Uncheck to use a custom color instead.\n\n"] = "根据你的资源类型为状态条上色——法力为蓝色、怒气为红色、能量为黄色。取消勾选可改用自定义颜色。\n\n"
L["Overridden by Innervate Highlight (mana) and Rage Highlight (rage) when those are active."] = "当激活时，会被激活（法力）和怒气高亮（怒气）覆盖。"
L["The custom color for the resource bar. Only used when Use Resource Color is unchecked.\n\n"] = "资源条的自定义颜色。仅在未勾选“使用资源颜色”时生效。\n\n"
L["Innervate Highlight"] = "激活高亮"
L["Changes the mana bar color when the Innervate buff is active, giving you immediate visual feedback that your mana regeneration is boosted."] = "当激活增益生效时改变法力条的颜色，立即给你视觉反馈，表明你的法力恢复已得到提升。"
L["Color"] = "颜色"
L["The color the resource bar changes to during Innervate."] = "激活期间资源条变为的颜色。"
L["Master toggle for rage bar coloring. When enabled, the bar changes color based on rage thresholds (e.g., flag rage cap risk) and when Heroic Strike or Cleave is queued onto your next swing."] = "怒气条上色的总开关。启用后，状态条会根据怒气阈值（例如标记怒气溢出风险）以及英勇打击或顺劈斩排队到你下次挥击时改变颜色。"
L["Rage Thresholds"] = "怒气阈值"
L["Threshold Coloring"] = "阈值上色"
L["Recolor the bar based on current rage. Three tiers (low/mid/high) gated by two thresholds."] = "根据当前怒气重新为状态条上色。由两个阈值划分为三档（低/中/高）。"
L["Low Threshold"] = "低阈值"
L["Below this rage value, the bar uses the Low color. Above it (and below the High threshold), the Mid color."] = "怒气低于此值时，状态条使用“低”颜色。高于此值（且低于高阈值）时使用“中”颜色。"
L["High Threshold"] = "高阈值"
L["At or above this rage value, the bar uses the High color (e.g., bright red to flag rage cap risk)."] = "怒气达到或高于此值时，状态条使用“高”颜色（例如亮红色以标记怒气溢出风险）。"
L["Low Color"] = "低颜色"
L["Bar color when rage is below the Low threshold."] = "怒气低于低阈值时的状态条颜色。"
L["Mid Color"] = "中颜色"
L["Bar color when rage is between the Low and High thresholds."] = "怒气介于低阈值和高阈值之间时的状态条颜色。"
L["High Color"] = "高颜色"
L["Bar color when rage is at or above the High threshold."] = "怒气达到或高于高阈值时的状态条颜色。"
L["Queued Ability Override"] = "排队技能覆盖"
L["Queue Override"] = "排队覆盖"
L["When a swing-reset ability (Heroic Strike, Cleave, Maul) is queued onto your next swing, override the threshold color with a per-ability color."] = "当挥击重置技能（英勇打击、顺劈斩、槌击）排队到你下次挥击时，用每个技能各自的颜色覆盖阈值颜色。"
L["Bar color when %s is queued onto your next swing."] = "%s 排队到你下次挥击时的状态条颜色。"
L["Rage Highlight"] = "怒气高亮"
L["Shows a bright highlight at the bar's current fill point — the glowing line where the filled and empty portions meet. Adds visual polish."] = "在状态条当前的填充点显示明亮高亮——即填充部分与空白部分交界处的发光线条。增添视觉精致感。"
L["How wide the spark highlight is in pixels. Larger values create a broader, more prominent glow."] = "光点高亮的宽度（像素）。值越大，辉光越宽、越显眼。"
L["Overflow"] = "溢出"
L["How far the spark glow extends beyond the top and bottom edges of the bar (in pixels). Higher values create a taller spark that 'overflows' past the bar."] = "光点辉光超出状态条上下边缘的距离（像素）。值越高，光点越高，越会“溢出”状态条之外。"
L["Hide at Full/Empty"] = "满/空时隐藏"
L["Hides the spark when the bar is completely full or completely empty, since there's no meaningful fill point to highlight in those states."] = "当状态条完全填满或完全为空时隐藏光点，因为在这些状态下没有有意义的填充点可供高亮。"
L["Overlays"] = "覆盖层"
L["Predicted Cost"] = "预测消耗"
L["Shows a darkened section on the resource bar representing the cost of abilities you are currently casting or have queued (e.g., Heroic Strike, Cleave). Gives you a preview of where your resource will be after the ability completes."] = "在资源条上显示一段变暗区域，代表你当前正在施放或已排队的技能（例如英勇打击、顺劈斩）的消耗。让你预览技能完成后资源所处的位置。"
L["Energy Ticker"] = "能量计时器"
L["Shows progress toward the next energy tick (energy regenerates every 2 seconds). Helps you time abilities to maximize energy efficiency."] = "显示距离下一次能量跳动的进度（能量每 2 秒恢复一次）。帮助你把握技能时机，以最大化能量效率。"
L["Style"] = "样式"
L["|cffffffffTicker Bar|r — Shows a separate thin bar below the resource bar that fills as the next tick approaches.\n\n|cffffffffSpark|r — Shows a moving spark overlay on the resource bar itself, which is more subtle."] = "|cffffffff计时条|r —— 在资源条下方显示一条单独的细条，随着下一次跳动临近而填满。\n\n|cffffffff光点|r —— 在资源条本身上显示一个移动的光点覆盖层，更为不易察觉。"
L["Show at Full Energy"] = "满能量时显示"
L["Keep the tick indicator running even when at full energy. Useful for timing openers — you can see exactly when the next tick will occur and use energy right before it arrives."] = "即使在满能量时也保持跳动指示器运行。对把握起手时机很有用——你可以准确看到下一次跳动何时发生，并在它到来前恰好用掉能量。"
L["Bar Settings"] = "条设置"
L["How tall the energy ticker bar is in pixels."] = "能量计时条的高度（像素）。"
L["Bar Offset"] = "条偏移"
L["Moves the energy ticker bar up or down relative to the resource bar. Positive values move it down, negative values move it up."] = "相对于资源条上下移动能量计时条。正值向下移动，负值向上移动。"
L["The color used for the energy ticker bar."] = "能量计时条使用的颜色。"
L["Spark Settings"] = "光点设置"
L["Spark Width"] = "光点宽度"
L["How wide the tick spark is in pixels."] = "跳动光点的宽度（像素）。"
L["Spark Height"] = "光点高度"
L["How tall the tick spark is relative to the resource bar. Values above 1.0 make the spark extend beyond the bar edges."] = "跳动光点相对于资源条的高度。大于 1.0 的值会使光点延伸到状态条边缘之外。"
L["Mana Ticker"] = "法力计时器"
L["Shows a moving spark on the resource bar indicating when your next mana tick will arrive. Mana regenerates in periodic ticks, and casting at the wrong time can delay your next tick — this indicator helps you cast at the optimal moment."] = "在资源条上显示一个移动的光点，指示你下一次法力跳动何时到来。法力以周期性跳动恢复，在错误的时机施法可能延迟你的下一次跳动——这个指示器帮助你在最佳时机施法。"
L["|cffffffffOutside 5 Second Rule|r — Only shows the tick timer when you haven't cast a spell in the last 5 seconds (when you're getting full spirit-based mana regeneration).\n\n|cffffffffNext Full Tick|r (Recommended) — Always active. After you cast a spell, it predicts exactly when your first full-rate mana tick will arrive and counts down to it. Cast right after the tick completes to get the most mana before your next spell."] = "|cffffffff五秒规则之外|r —— 仅当你在过去 5 秒内没有施放法术时（即你正获得基于精神的全额法力恢复时）显示跳动计时器。\n\n|cffffffff下次完整跳动|r（推荐）—— 始终激活。在你施放法术后，它会精确预测你第一次全速法力跳动何时到来并倒计时。在跳动完成后立即施法，可在下一次法术前获得最多的法力。"
L["How wide the mana tick spark is in pixels."] = "法力跳动光点的宽度（像素）。"
L["How tall the mana tick spark is relative to the resource bar. Values above 1.0 make it extend beyond the bar edges."] = "法力跳动光点相对于资源条的高度。大于 1.0 的值会使其延伸到状态条边缘之外。"
L["Mana Bar (Druid)"] = "法力条（德鲁伊）"
L["Shows a secondary mana bar below the resource bar while in Cat Form or Bear Form, so you can monitor mana for shifting and casting."] = "在猎豹形态或熊形态下，于资源条下方显示一条副法力条，以便你监控用于变形和施法的法力。"
L["Show a secondary mana bar below the resource bar while shapeshifted."] = "在变形时于资源条下方显示一条副法力条。"
L["How tall the secondary mana bar is in pixels."] = "副法力条的高度（像素）。"
L["Show Spark"] = "显示光点"
L["Shows a glowing spark at the current fill position on the mana bar."] = "在法力条当前填充位置显示一个发光的光点。"
L["The color used for the secondary mana bar."] = "副法力条使用的颜色。"
L["Show Mana Ticker"] = "显示法力计时器"
L["Shows the mana tick spark on this bar while in form. When disabled, the mana ticker only appears on the main resource bar in caster form."] = "在变形时于此条上显示法力跳动光点。禁用后，法力计时器仅在施法形态下出现在主资源条上。"
L["Form Cost Marker"] = "形态消耗标记"
L["Shows a vertical line on the mana bar when your mana is too low to re-enter your current shapeshift form. The line indicates the mana threshold needed, so you can see how close you are to being able to shift back."] = "当你的法力过低、无法重新进入当前变形形态时，在法力条上显示一条竖线。该线指示所需的法力阈值，让你看出距离能够变回形态还有多近。"
L["Controls what text is shown on the Druid mana bar.\n\n|cffffffffCurrent|r — Shows your actual mana.\n|cffffffffPercent|r — Shows your mana percentage.\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Shows both.\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max|r — Shows current and maximum.\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max (%)|r — Shows current, maximum, and percentage.\n|cffffffffDeficit|r — Shows how much is missing. Hidden at full.\n|cffffffffNone|r — Hides the text."] = "控制德鲁伊法力条上显示的文本。\n\n|cffffffff当前值|r —— 显示你的实际法力。\n|cffffffff百分比|r —— 显示你的法力百分比。\n|cffffffff两者|r —— 同时显示。\n|cffffffff当前值 / 最大值|r —— 显示当前值和最大值。\n|cffffffff当前值 / 最大值 (%)|r —— 显示当前值、最大值和百分比。\n|cffffffff缺口|r —— 显示缺失的数量。满值时隐藏。\n|cffffffff无|r —— 隐藏文本。"
L["Controls how numbers are displayed."] = "控制数字的显示方式。"
L["Font size for the mana bar text."] = "法力条文本的字号。"
L["Text outline style for the druid mana bar."] = "德鲁伊法力条的文本描边样式。"
L["Health Bar"] = "生命值条"
L["Your character's health bar with heal prediction."] = "你角色的生命值条，带有治疗预测。"
L["Shows a bar displaying your current health above the resource bar. Gives you a quick glance at your survivability without looking at your unit frame."] = "在资源条上方显示一条状态条，展示你当前的生命值。让你无需查看单位框体即可快速了解自己的生存能力。"
L["How wide the health bar is in pixels."] = "生命值条的宽度（像素）。"
L["How tall/thick the health bar is in pixels. Changing this will automatically adjust the position of elements above it."] = "生命值条的高度/厚度（像素）。更改此项会自动调整其上方元素的位置。"
L["Controls what text is shown on the health bar.\n\n|cffffffffCurrent|r — Shows your actual health (e.g., 3256).\n|cffffffffPercent|r — Shows your health percentage (e.g., 71%).\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Shows both (e.g., 3256 (71%)).\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max|r — Shows current and maximum (e.g., 3256 / 4580).\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max (%)|r — Shows current, maximum, and percentage (e.g., 3256 / 4580 (71%)).\n|cffffffffDeficit|r — Shows how much health is missing (e.g., -1324). Hidden at full.\n|cffffffffNone|r — Hides the text entirely."] = "控制生命值条上显示的文本。\n\n|cffffffff当前值|r —— 显示你的实际生命值（例如 3256）。\n|cffffffff百分比|r —— 显示你的生命值百分比（例如 71%）。\n|cffffffff两者|r —— 同时显示（例如 3256 (71%)）。\n|cffffffff当前值 / 最大值|r —— 显示当前值和最大值（例如 3256 / 4580）。\n|cffffffff当前值 / 最大值 (%)|r —— 显示当前值、最大值和百分比（例如 3256 / 4580 (71%)）。\n|cffffffff缺口|r —— 显示缺失的生命值（例如 -1324）。满值时隐藏。\n|cffffffff无|r —— 完全隐藏文本。"
L["Font size for the health text. Larger sizes are easier to read but may overflow small bars."] = "生命值文本的字号。较大的字号更易读，但在小条上可能溢出。"
L["Text outline style for the health bar."] = "生命值条的文本描边样式。"
L["Use Class Color"] = "使用职业颜色"
L["Colors the health bar using your class color (e.g., brown for Warriors, purple for Warlocks) instead of the standard green."] = "使用你的职业颜色（例如战士为棕色、术士为紫色）为生命值条上色，而非标准的绿色。"
L["The custom color for the health bar. Only used when Use Class Color is unchecked."] = "生命值条的自定义颜色。仅在未勾选“使用职业颜色”时生效。"
L["Heal Prediction"] = "治疗预测"
L["Shows a lighter overlay on the health bar representing incoming heals. The overlay extends from your current health into the missing health area, giving you a preview of where your health will be after heals land."] = "在生命值条上显示一个较浅的覆盖层，代表即将到来的治疗。覆盖层从你当前的生命值延伸到缺失生命值的区域，让你预览治疗落定后生命值所处的位置。"
L["Pet Health Bar"] = "宠物生命值条"
L["Your pet's health bar. Automatically hides when no pet is active."] = "你宠物的生命值条。当没有激活的宠物时自动隐藏。"
L["Shows a bar displaying your pet's current health. Automatically hides when you have no active pet."] = "显示一条状态条，展示你宠物当前的生命值。当你没有激活的宠物时自动隐藏。"
L["How wide the pet health bar is in pixels."] = "宠物生命值条的宽度（像素）。"
L["How tall/thick the pet health bar is in pixels."] = "宠物生命值条的高度/厚度（像素）。"
L["Controls what text is shown on the pet health bar.\n\n|cffffffffCurrent|r — Shows actual health.\n|cffffffffPercent|r — Shows health percentage.\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Shows both.\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max|r — Shows current and maximum.\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max (%)|r — Shows current, maximum, and percentage.\n|cffffffffDeficit|r — Shows how much health is missing. Hidden at full.\n|cffffffffNone|r — Hides the text."] = "控制宠物生命值条上显示的文本。\n\n|cffffffff当前值|r —— 显示实际生命值。\n|cffffffff百分比|r —— 显示生命值百分比。\n|cffffffff两者|r —— 同时显示。\n|cffffffff当前值 / 最大值|r —— 显示当前值和最大值。\n|cffffffff当前值 / 最大值 (%)|r —— 显示当前值、最大值和百分比。\n|cffffffff缺口|r —— 显示缺失的生命值。满值时隐藏。\n|cffffffff无|r —— 隐藏文本。"
L["Font size for the pet health text."] = "宠物生命值文本的字号。"
L["Text outline style for the pet health bar."] = "宠物生命值条的文本描边样式。"
L["The color for the pet health bar."] = "宠物生命值条的颜色。"
L["Shows a lighter overlay on the pet health bar representing incoming heals."] = "在宠物生命值条上显示一个较浅的覆盖层，代表即将到来的治疗。"
L["Combo Points"] = "连击点"
L["Horizontal combo point display below the resource bar."] = "资源条下方的水平连击点显示。"
L["Shows combo point bars below the resource bar. For Druids, this only appears while in Cat Form."] = "在资源条下方显示连击点条。对德鲁伊而言，此项仅在猎豹形态下出现。"
L["Size & Layout"] = "大小与布局"
L["The total width of the combo points display in pixels."] = "连击点显示的总宽度（像素）。"
L["The height of each combo point bar in pixels. Smaller values create a more subtle display."] = "每个连击点条的高度（像素）。较小的值会带来更不显眼的显示。"
L["Bar Spacing"] = "条间距"
L["The gap in pixels between each individual combo point segment."] = "每个连击点段之间的间距（像素）。"
L["The color used for active combo point segments."] = "已激活连击点段使用的颜色。"
L["Aura Tracker"] = "光环追踪器"
L["The Aura Tracker shows small icons for important temporary buffs — class procs (Enrage, Flurry, Clearcasting), external buffs (Bloodlust, Power Infusion, Innervate), and any custom auras you add.\n\nUse the tabs above to configure which auras to show."] = "光环追踪器为重要的临时增益显示小图标——职业触发（激怒、乱舞、节能施法）、外部增益（嗜血、能量灌注、激活），以及你添加的任何自定义光环。\n\n使用上方的选项卡来配置要显示哪些光环。"
L["Enable Aura Tracker"] = "启用光环追踪器"
L["Master toggle for the Aura Tracker feature. When disabled, no aura icons will be shown."] = "光环追踪器功能的总开关。禁用后，将不显示任何光环图标。"
L["Layout"] = "布局"
L["How big the aura icons are in pixels. These are typically smaller than ability icons since they're just indicators. 20-28 pixels works well for most people."] = "光环图标的大小（像素）。由于它们只是指示器，通常比技能图标小。20-28 像素适合大多数人。"
L["The gap in pixels between each aura icon when multiple auras are active at once."] = "当多个光环同时激活时，每个光环图标之间的间距（像素）。"
L["Makes aura icons shorter by shrinking height while keeping width the same. Useful if you want compact spell rows but prefer aura icons to stay more square and readable."] = "通过缩小高度而保持宽度不变，使光环图标变矮。如果你想要紧凑的法术行，但又希望光环图标更接近正方形且易读，此项很有用。"
L["Glow"] = "辉光"
L["Edge Glow"] = "边缘辉光"
L["Shows a glowing animated border around active aura icons, making them stand out and drawing your eye to important buffs."] = "在已激活的光环图标周围显示发光的动画边框，使其突出并吸引你的目光关注重要增益。"
L["Backdrop Intensity"] = "背景强度"
L["Controls the brightness of the soft colored halo that appears behind each aura icon. Higher values make the glow more prominent. Set to 0 to turn it off completely."] = "控制出现在每个光环图标背后的柔和彩色光晕的亮度。值越高辉光越显眼。设为 0 可完全关闭。"
L["Backdrop Size"] = "背景大小"
L["How far the backdrop glow extends outward from each aura icon. Larger values create a wider, softer halo."] = "背景辉光从每个光环图标向外延伸的距离。值越大，光晕越宽、越柔和。"
L["Animation"] = "动画"
L["Show Duration"] = "显示持续时间"
L["Displays the remaining time on aura buffs as text on the icon. Disable if you prefer a cleaner look or if it overlaps with stack counts."] = "在图标上以文本形式显示光环增益的剩余时间。如果你偏好更简洁的外观，或它与叠加层数重叠，可禁用此项。"
L["Text outline style for aura tracker text."] = "光环追踪器文本的文本描边样式。"
L["Slide Animation"] = "滑动动画"
L["When auras appear or disappear, the remaining icons smoothly slide to re-center instead of snapping instantly. Disable for instant repositioning."] = "当光环出现或消失时，剩余的图标平滑滑动以重新居中，而非瞬时跳位。禁用可瞬时重新定位。"
L["Activation Pop"] = "激活弹跳"
L["How much the icon briefly grows when an aura activates or refreshes. Set to 100% to disable the pop animation."] = "当光环激活或刷新时图标短暂放大的幅度。设为 100% 可禁用弹跳动画。"
L["Sort Order"] = "排序顺序"
L["How active aura icons are arranged.\n\n|cffffffffActivation Order|r — First-activated aura appears on the left, newest on the right.\n\n|cffffffffFixed|r — Icons stay in a consistent order based on spell registration (class procs first, then externals, then custom).\n\n|cffffffffLeast Remaining|r — Aura closest to expiring appears on the left. Icons re-sort as durations tick down."] = "已激活光环图标的排列方式。\n\n|cffffffff激活顺序|r —— 最先激活的光环显示在左侧，最新的在右侧。\n\n|cffffffff固定|r —— 图标按法术注册顺序保持一致排列（先职业触发，再外部，最后自定义）。\n\n|cffffffff剩余最少|r —— 最接近结束的光环显示在左侧。图标随持续时间递减而重新排序。"
L["Activation Order"] = "激活顺序"
L["Fixed"] = "固定"
L["Least Remaining"] = "剩余最少"
L["Bars"] = "条"
L["Auras set to \"Bar\" mode (via the Display dropdown in the aura list tabs) render as a vertical stack of timer bars below the icon row. These settings control how those bars look."] = "设为“条”模式的光环（通过光环列表选项卡中的“显示”下拉菜单）会在图标行下方渲染为一组垂直堆叠的计时条。这些设置控制那些条的外观。"
L["Bar Width"] = "条宽度"
L["Width of each timer bar in pixels."] = "每个计时条的宽度（像素）。"
L["Height of each timer bar in pixels. The spell icon is sized to match."] = "每个计时条的高度（像素）。法术图标会调整大小以匹配。"
L["Vertical gap in pixels between stacked bars."] = "堆叠的条之间的垂直间距（像素）。"
L["Font size for the bar's name and timer text."] = "条的名称和计时文本的字号。"
L["Text outline style for bar text."] = "条文本的文本描边样式。"
L["Fallback fill color for bars whose spell has no icon-sampled color (most do). Each aura's color is normally taken from its icon; you can override per aura in the aura list tabs."] = "用于其法术没有图标采样颜色（大多数都有）的条的回退填充颜色。每个光环的颜色通常取自其图标；你可以在光环列表选项卡中为每个光环单独覆盖。"
L["Show Icon"] = "显示图标"
L["Show the spell icon at the left edge of each bar."] = "在每个条的左边缘显示法术图标。"
L["Show Name"] = "显示名称"
L["Show the aura name on each bar."] = "在每个条上显示光环名称。"
L["Show Timer"] = "显示计时"
L["Show the remaining-time text on each bar."] = "在每个条上显示剩余时间文本。"
L["Show a spark at the fill edge of each bar."] = "在每个条的填充边缘显示一个光点。"
L["Default Sound"] = "默认声音"
L["Sound to play when any aura activates. Individual auras can override this in the aura list tabs."] = "任何光环激活时播放的声音。各个光环可在光环列表选项卡中覆盖此项。"
L["Play on Refresh"] = "刷新时播放"
L["Also play the sound when an aura refreshes (is reapplied while already active). Useful for procs like Mace Stun where each trigger matters. Individual auras can override this in the aura list tabs."] = "当光环刷新（在已激活时重新施加）时也播放声音。对于像钝器击晕这类每次触发都很重要的触发效果很有用。各个光环可在光环列表选项卡中覆盖此项。"
L["Swing Bar"] = "挥击条"
L["Your character automatically fires auto-shots on a timer. If you cast an ability too late in the timer, it 'clips' (delays) your next auto-shot, costing you DPS. The bar turns green when it's safe to cast and red when casting would clip. Once you learn Steady Shot, a yellow zone appears for the window where Steady Shot would clip but instants and movement are still safe."] = "你的角色会按计时器自动射击。如果你在计时器中过晚施放技能，会“截断”（延迟）你的下一次自动射击，损失 DPS。当可以安全施法时状态条变绿，当施法会造成截断时变红。学会瞄准射击后，会出现一个黄色区域，标示瞄准射击会截断但瞬发技能和移动仍然安全的窗口。"
L["Seal twisting lets you get two seal procs on a single melee swing by swapping seals right before the hit lands. The bar turns green during the twist window — the last ~0.4 seconds before impact — telling you when to swap to your second seal."] = "圣印交替让你在命中即将落定前切换圣印，从而在一次近战挥击上获得两次圣印触发。在交替窗口期间——即命中前约 0.4 秒——状态条会变绿，告诉你何时切换到第二个圣印。"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer — a bar that fills up as your next auto-attack approaches. Auto-hides between pulls."] = "追踪你的近战挥击计时器——一条随着下一次自动攻击临近而填满的状态条。在两次拉怪之间自动隐藏。"
L["Two bars track your main-hand and off-hand swing timers. When both weapons swing at the same time (synced), your Flurry haste charges aren't wasted on isolated off-hand hits, and Windfury extra attacks land alongside your normal swings. Bars turn green when synced and red when desynced — meaning one weapon has drifted ahead of the other."] = "两条状态条分别追踪你的主手和副手挥击计时器。当两件武器同时挥击（同步）时，你的乱舞急速充能不会浪费在孤立的副手命中上，且风怒的额外攻击会与你的正常挥击一同落下。同步时状态条变绿，不同步时变红——意味着一件武器已比另一件提前。"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer. Slam resets this timer, so for maximum DPS you want to Slam right after a swing lands (when the bar reaches the end and resets). This avoids losing auto-attack time to the Slam cast.\n\n"] = "追踪你的近战挥击计时器。猛击会重置此计时器，因此为了最大化 DPS，你应在一次挥击落定后立即猛击（当状态条到达末端并重置时）。这可避免因猛击的施放而损失自动攻击时间。\n\n"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer — a bar that fills up as your next auto-attack approaches. Auto-hides between pulls.\n\n"] = "追踪你的近战挥击计时器——一条随着下一次自动攻击临近而填满的状态条。在两次拉怪之间自动隐藏。\n\n"
L["Tracks your auto-attack timer for wanding or melee. Only appears while actively attacking and auto-hides when you stop."] = "追踪你用于持杖攻击或近战的自动攻击计时器。仅在积极攻击时出现，停止时自动隐藏。"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer. Shows separate main-hand and off-hand bars when dual-wielding."] = "追踪你的近战挥击计时器。双持时显示独立的主手和副手状态条。"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer in Cat or Bear Form. Bear Form's 2.5s swing is useful for timing Maul. Auto-hides when not actively swinging."] = "追踪你在猎豹或熊形态下的近战挥击计时器。熊形态 2.5 秒的挥击对把握槌击时机很有用。在不积极挥击时自动隐藏。"
L["Shows a weapon swing timer bar that fills as your next auto-attack approaches. Includes class-specific colored zones: Hunter shot clipping, Ret Paladin seal twisting, Enhancement/Warrior dual-wield sync. Auto-hides when not actively swinging."] = "显示一条武器挥击计时条，随着下一次自动攻击临近而填满。包含职业特定的彩色区域：猎人的射击截断、惩戒圣骑士的圣印交替、增强/战士的双持同步。在不积极挥击时自动隐藏。"
L["Width of the swing bar in pixels."] = "挥击条的宽度（像素）。"
L["Height of the swing bar in pixels (single weapon). Per-class/spec: each class or spec remembers its own height."] = "挥击条的高度（像素，单件武器）。按职业/专精：每个职业或专精会记住自己的高度。"
L["Wand Height"] = "魔杖高度"
L["Height of the swing bar in pixels for wand users (Mage, Priest, Warlock)."] = "持杖用户（法师、牧师、术士）的挥击条高度（像素）。"
L["Dual-Wield Height"] = "双持高度"
