L["Class Options"] = "职业选项"
L["Enable Shot Zones"] = "启用射击区域"
L["Color the bar by auto-shot timing:\n\n|cffffffffGreen|r — Safe to cast anything and move freely.\n|cffffffffYellow|r — Steady Shot would clip, but instants and movement are safe.\n|cffffffffRed|r — Don't move or cast Multi-Shot (auto-shot animation playing)."] = "根据自动射击时机为状态条上色：\n\n|cffffffff绿色|r —— 可安全施放任何技能并自由移动。\n|cffffffff黄色|r —— 瞄准射击会截断，但瞬发技能和移动是安全的。\n|cffffffff红色|r —— 不要移动或施放多重射击（自动射击动画正在播放）。"
L["Safe Zone (Green)"] = "安全区（绿色）"
L["Bar color when it's safe to cast and move."] = "可以安全施法和移动时的状态条颜色。"
L["Steady Zone (Yellow)"] = "瞄准区（黄色）"
L["Bar color when Steady Shot would clip, but instant shots and movement are still safe."] = "瞄准射击会截断，但瞬发射击和移动仍然安全时的状态条颜色。"
L["Stop Zone (Red)"] = "停止区（红色）"
L["Bar color when moving would cancel your auto-shot and Multi-Shot would clip."] = "移动会取消你的自动射击且多重射击会截断时的状态条颜色。"
L["Enable Twist Window"] = "启用交替窗口"
L["Highlight the last ~0.4 seconds before your melee swing with a different color — your cue to swap seals for seal twisting."] = "用不同的颜色高亮你近战挥击前的最后约 0.4 秒——提示你为圣印交替切换圣印。"
L["Twist Window Color"] = "交替窗口颜色"
L["Bar color during the seal twist window."] = "圣印交替窗口期间的状态条颜色。"
L["Zone Opacity"] = "区域不透明度"
L["Opacity of the background zone indicators that preview upcoming color changes on the bar."] = "预览状态条上即将发生的颜色变化的背景区域指示器的不透明度。"
L["Melee Weaving"] = "近战穿插"
L["Show both ranged and melee swing bars simultaneously. For advanced hunters who weave melee attacks (e.g., Raptor Strike) between auto-shots."] = "同时显示远程和近战挥击条。适用于在自动射击之间穿插近战攻击（例如猛禽一击）的高阶猎人。"
L["Enable Sync Colors"] = "启用同步颜色"
L["Sync Threshold"] = "同步阈值"
L["Spell Config"] = "法术配置"
L["Spells"] = "法术"
L["Click the button below to open the spell configuration window — enable/disable spells, reorder them, and drag between rows."] = "点击下方按钮打开法术配置窗口——启用/禁用法术、重新排序，以及在各行之间拖动。"
L["Open Spell Configuration"] = "打开法术配置"
L["Opens the spell configuration window where you can enable/disable spells, reorder them, and move them between rows using drag-and-drop."] = "打开法术配置窗口，你可以在其中启用/禁用法术、重新排序，并使用拖放在各行之间移动。"
L["Consumables"] = "消耗品"
L["Track combat consumables on your HUD — potions, runes, and other items you use mid-fight. Each icon shows the item cooldown, buff duration, and bag count. For long-duration pre-pull buffs (elixirs, flasks, food), use a consumable-tracking addon like NovaConsumesHelper."] = "在你的 HUD 上追踪战斗消耗品——药水、符文以及你在战斗中使用的其他物品。每个图标会显示物品冷却、增益持续时间和背包数量。对于长持续时间的开怪前增益（合剂、药剂、食物），请使用 NovaConsumesHelper 等消耗品追踪插件。"
L["Spec not yet detected"] = "尚未检测到专精"
L["Add Consumables"] = "添加消耗品"
L["Add by Item ID"] = "按物品 ID 添加"
L["Enter an item ID to track any consumable not listed above. You can find item IDs on Wowhead (the number in the URL) or with the idTip addon."] = "输入物品 ID 以追踪上面未列出的任何消耗品。你可以在 Wowhead 上找到物品 ID（URL 中的数字），或使用 idTip 插件。"
L["Invalid input — enter a numeric item ID."] = "无效输入——请输入数字物品 ID。"
L["Item "] = "物品 "
L["Added:"] = "已添加："
L["Tracked Consumables"] = "已追踪的消耗品"
L["Sounds"] = "声音"
L["Play a sound when an ability becomes ready — when it comes off cooldown, becomes usable, or meets resource requirements. Set a default sound for all abilities, or override individual spells below.\n\nSound plays for all rows regardless of the Ready Glow row filter. Other settings still apply: combat-only, pre-trigger time, and once vs. re-trigger mode."] = "当技能就绪时播放声音——即它脱离冷却、变为可用或满足资源要求时。为所有技能设置一个默认声音，或在下方覆盖各个法术。\n\n无论“就绪辉光”的行过滤如何，声音都会为所有行播放。其他设置仍然适用：仅限战斗、提前触发时间，以及单次与重新触发模式。"
L["Support"] = "支持"
L["Join the "] = "加入 "
L["Veev Addons Discord"] = "Veev Addons Discord"
L["Discord URL"] = "Discord 网址"
L["Press Ctrl+C to copy the URL."] = "按 Ctrl+C 复制网址。"
L["VeevHUD is built with a $200/mo Claude subscription, late-night coding sessions, and unhealthy amounts of caffeine. I code for the love of the game, not for profit. Donations to help offset the costs are appreciated but never expected!"] = "VeevHUD 是用每月 200 美元的 Claude 订阅、深夜的编程时光，以及大量不健康的咖啡因打造的。我编程是出于对游戏的热爱，而非为了盈利。如果你愿意捐助以帮助分摊成本，我深表感激，但绝不强求！"
L["Donate URL"] = "捐助网址"
L["Cooldown Pulse"] = "冷却脉冲"
L["Flashes a large icon in the center of the screen when a tracked ability comes off cooldown. A prominent visual cue that complements the ready glow on ability icons."] = "当被追踪的技能脱离冷却时，在屏幕中央闪现一个大图标。这是一种显眼的视觉提示，作为技能图标上就绪辉光的补充。"
L["Enable Cooldown Pulse"] = "启用冷却脉冲"
L["Master toggle for the cooldown pulse effect. When enabled, a large icon briefly flashes on screen each time a tracked ability finishes its cooldown."] = "冷却脉冲效果的总开关。启用后，每当被追踪的技能完成冷却时，屏幕上会短暂闪现一个大图标。"
L["How large the flashing icon appears on screen, in pixels."] = "闪现图标在屏幕上的大小（像素）。"
L["Peak opacity of the icon during the flash. Lower values create a more subtle, ghostly effect."] = "闪现期间图标的峰值不透明度。较低的值会带来更微妙、更虚幻的效果。"
L["X Offset"] = "X 偏移"
L["Horizontal offset from the center of your screen. Negative values move left, positive values move right."] = "相对于屏幕中心的水平偏移。负值向左移动，正值向右移动。"
L["Y Offset"] = "Y 偏移"
L["Vertical offset from the center of your screen. Negative values move down, positive values move up."] = "相对于屏幕中心的垂直偏移。负值向下移动，正值向上移动。"
L["Filtering"] = "过滤"
L["Which ability rows trigger the cooldown pulse. Primary Row is your core rotation — the most impactful notifications. Add Secondary to include throughput cooldowns too."] = "哪些技能行触发冷却脉冲。主要行是你的核心循环——影响最大的提示。添加次要行可一并包含输出爆发技能。"
L["Only In Combat"] = "仅在战斗中"
L["Only show cooldown pulses while you are in combat."] = "仅在你处于战斗中时显示冷却脉冲。"
L["Ignore Cooldowns Below"] = "忽略低于以下的冷却"
L["Skip pulses for abilities with cooldowns shorter than this. Useful for filtering out short-cooldown rotational spells. Set to 0 to include everything."] = "跳过冷却短于此值的技能的脉冲。可用于过滤掉短冷却的循环法术。设为 0 可包含所有技能。"
L["Fade In Effect"] = "淡入效果"
L["Size effect while the icon fades in. Grow: starts small, grows to normal. Shrink: starts big, shrinks to normal. None: no size change."] = "图标淡入时的大小效果。放大：从小开始，变大到正常。缩小：从大开始，缩小到正常。无：不改变大小。"
L["Grow"] = "放大"
L["Shrink"] = "缩小"
L["Fade Out Effect"] = "淡出效果"
L["Size effect while the icon fades out. Grow: grows from normal to big. Shrink: shrinks from normal to small. None: no size change."] = "图标淡出时的大小效果。放大：从正常变大到更大。缩小：从正常缩小到更小。无：不改变大小。"
L["Fade In"] = "淡入"
L["How long the icon takes to fade in, in seconds."] = "图标淡入所需的时间（秒）。"
L["Hold Time"] = "保持时间"
L["How long the icon stays at peak opacity before fading out. Set to 0 for a quick flash, or increase for a longer notification."] = "图标在淡出前保持峰值不透明度的时间。设为 0 可快速闪现，调大则可获得更长的提示。"
L["Fade Out"] = "淡出"
L["How long the icon takes to fade out, in seconds."] = "图标淡出所需的时间（秒）。"
L["Early Trigger"] = "提前触发"
L["Fire the pulse this many seconds before the cooldown finishes. Gives you a head start on reacting. Set to 0 to pulse at the exact moment the ability becomes ready."] = "在冷却结束前提前这么多秒触发脉冲。让你抢先反应。设为 0 可在技能恰好就绪的那一刻触发脉冲。"
L["Test Pulse"] = "测试脉冲"
L["Plays a test pulse so you can preview your current settings."] = "播放一次测试脉冲，以便你预览当前设置。"
L["No consumables added yet. Select one from the dropdowns above."] = "尚未添加消耗品。请从上方的下拉菜单中选择一个。"
L["Remove"] = "移除"
L["Remove this consumable from tracking."] = "将此消耗品从追踪中移除。"
L["Any"] = "任意"
L["Own"] = "自己"
L["Others"] = "他人"
L["Icon"] = "图标"
L["Show this aura as a compact icon in the icon row, or as a status bar with name and timer in the bar stack below the icons."] = "将此光环显示为图标行中的紧凑图标，或显示为图标下方条堆叠中带名称和计时的状态条。"
L["Fill color for this aura's timer bar (Bar display mode only). Defaults to a vibrant color sampled from the spell's icon — change it here to override."] = "此光环计时条的填充颜色（仅“条”显示模式）。默认为从法术图标采样的鲜艳颜色——在此处更改可覆盖。"
L["Toggle which class procs are tracked. Enabled procs appear as icons in the Aura Tracker when active."] = "切换追踪哪些职业触发。已启用的触发在激活时会以图标形式出现在光环追踪器中。"
L["Show this aura in the tracker."] = "在追踪器中显示此光环。"
L["Show the glowing border and backdrop halo when this aura is active. Disable for auras you want to track quietly without the glow drawing your eye."] = "当此光环激活时显示发光边框和背景光晕。对于你想悄悄追踪而不让辉光吸引目光的光环，可禁用此项。"
L["Sound to play when this aura activates. 'None' uses the global default from the Sound section above."] = "此光环激活时播放的声音。“无”使用上方“声音”部分的全局默认值。"
L["Refresh"] = "刷新"
L["Also play the sound when this aura refreshes (is reapplied while already active)."] = "当此光环刷新（在已激活时重新施加）时也播放声音。"
L["Settings"] = "设置"
L["Class Procs"] = "职业触发"
L["External Buffs"] = "外部增益"
L["Custom Auras"] = "自定义光环"
L["Toggle which external buffs are tracked (from other players, consumables, or PvP powerups). These appear as icons in the Aura Tracker when active on you."] = "切换追踪哪些外部增益（来自其他玩家、消耗品或 PvP 增益道具）。当它们在你身上激活时，会以图标形式出现在光环追踪器中。"
L["Track %s (ID: %s)"] = "追踪 %s（ID：%s）"
L["Show the glowing border and backdrop halo when this aura is active."] = "当此光环激活时显示发光边框和背景光晕。"
L["Sound to play when this aura activates. 'None' uses the global default."] = "此光环激活时播放的声音。“无”使用全局默认值。"
L["Also play the sound when this aura refreshes."] = "当此光环刷新时也播放声音。"
L["Add custom auras to track by spell ID or spell name. These work like procs — the icon appears when the buff is active on you."] = "通过法术 ID 或法术名称添加要追踪的自定义光环。它们的工作方式类似触发——当增益在你身上激活时图标会出现。"
L["Spell ID or Name"] = "法术 ID 或名称"
L["Enter a numeric spell ID or exact spell name and press Enter to add.\n\nYou can find spell IDs on Wowhead (the number at the end of the spell URL), or install the idTip addon to see spell IDs directly in tooltips."] = "输入数字法术 ID 或准确的法术名称并按回车键添加。\n\n你可以在 Wowhead 上找到法术 ID（法术 URL 末尾的数字），或安装 idTip 插件以直接在提示信息中查看法术 ID。"
L["(icon shows when buff is active)"] = "（增益激活时显示图标）"
L["(by name — icon shows when buff is active)"] = "（按名称——增益激活时显示图标）"
L["Current Custom Auras"] = "当前自定义光环"
L["Recently Seen Buffs"] = "最近见到的增益"
L["No custom auras added yet."] = "尚未添加自定义光环。"
L["(ID: "] = "（ID："
L["Del"] = "删除"
L["Remove this custom aura."] = "移除此自定义光环。"
L["No recent buffs recorded yet. Play for a bit and reopen this tab."] = "尚未记录任何最近的增益。游玩一会儿后重新打开此选项卡。"
L["All recent buffs are already tracked."] = "所有最近的增益均已被追踪。"
L["Add"] = "添加"
L["In Combat"] = "战斗中"
L["Out of Combat"] = "脱离战斗"
L["Player"] = "玩家"
L["Party"] = "小队"
L["Raid"] = "团队"
L["Enable or disable this buff reminder."] = "启用或禁用此增益提醒。"
L["Time Threshold"] = "时间阈值"
L["Show the reminder when the buff has less than this many seconds remaining. Set to 0 to only remind when the buff is completely missing."] = "当增益的剩余时间少于这么多秒时显示提醒。设为 0 则仅在增益完全缺失时提醒。"
L["Combat"] = "战斗"
L["When to show this reminder based on combat state."] = "根据战斗状态决定何时显示此提醒。"
L["Track"] = "追踪"
L["Who to check for this buff.\n\n|cffffffffPlayer|r: Only check yourself.\n|cffffffffParty|r: Check all party members (or only yourself if solo).\n|cffffffffRaid|r: Check all raid members (downsizes to party if not in a raid)."] = "为此增益检查谁。\n\n|cffffffff玩家|r：仅检查你自己。\n|cffffffff小队|r：检查所有小队成员（若单人则仅检查你自己）。\n|cffffffff团队|r：检查所有团队成员（若不在团队中则缩减为小队）。"
L["Sound to play when this buff reminder appears. 'None' uses the global default from the General tab."] = "此增益提醒出现时播放的声音。“无”使用“常规”选项卡的全局默认值。"
L["Min Stacks"] = "最小叠加"
L["Show the reminder when stacks fall below this number. Set to 0 to disable stack checking. This is an OR condition with the time threshold."] = "当叠加层数低于此数值时显示提醒。设为 0 可禁用叠加检测。这与时间阈值是“或”的关系。"
L["Priority"] = "优先级"
L["Which spell to remind first when no buff from this group is active."] = "当此组中没有增益激活时，优先提醒哪个法术。"
L["Main Hand"] = "主手"
L["Show a reminder when your main hand weapon is missing an enchant. Disable this if you prefer to benefit from a Shaman's Windfury Totem instead."] = "当你的主手武器缺少附魔时显示提醒。如果你更愿意从萨满的风怒图腾中获益，可禁用此项。"
L["Off Hand"] = "副手"
L["Show a reminder when your off hand weapon is missing an enchant."] = "当你的副手武器缺少附魔时显示提醒。"
L["Configure which buff reminders are active. Settings on this tab are per-spec — switching specs loads that spec's configuration."] = "配置哪些增益提醒处于激活状态。此选项卡上的设置按专精区分——切换专精会加载该专精的配置。"
L["Show Only Known Spells"] = "仅显示已学法术"
L["Only shows spells you currently know. Disable to see all class buff spells, including ones you haven't learned yet."] = "仅显示你当前已学会的法术。禁用可查看所有职业增益法术，包括你尚未学会的。"
L["Buff Reminders"] = "增益提醒"
L["Buff Reminders show a large, semi-transparent icon when a long-duration buff you should maintain is missing or about to expire. They are separate from the main HUD icons and only appear when action is needed.\n\nReminders automatically check that you know the spell and have the resources to cast it. Use the Spells tab to configure individual reminders."] = "当你应当维持的长持续时间增益缺失或即将结束时，增益提醒会显示一个大而半透明的图标。它们与主 HUD 图标分离，仅在需要采取行动时出现。\n\n提醒会自动检查你已学会该法术且有资源施放它。使用“法术”选项卡来配置各个提醒。"
L["Enable Buff Reminders"] = "启用增益提醒"
L["Master toggle for the Buff Reminders feature. When disabled, no buff reminder icons will be shown."] = "增益提醒功能的总开关。禁用后，将不显示任何增益提醒图标。"
L["The size of buff reminder icons in pixels."] = "增益提醒图标的大小（像素）。"
L["The horizontal gap between buff reminder icons."] = "增益提醒图标之间的水平间距。"
L["Icon Opacity"] = "图标不透明度"
L["The opacity of the buff reminder icons."] = "增益提醒图标的不透明度。"
L["Text outline style for buff reminder text."] = "增益提醒文本的文本描边样式。"
L["Pulse Animation"] = "脉冲动画"
L["Reminder icons gently pulse to draw attention."] = "提醒图标轻柔地脉动以吸引注意。"
L["Respect Resource Cost"] = "遵循资源消耗"
L["Only show buff reminders when you have enough resources (mana, rage, energy) to cast the spell. Uncheck to always show reminders for missing buffs regardless of your current resource level."] = "仅当你有足够的资源（法力、怒气、能量）施放该法术时才显示增益提醒。取消勾选则无论你当前的资源水平如何，都始终为缺失的增益显示提醒。"
L["Show While Resting"] = "休息时显示"
L["Show buff reminders while in inns and cities."] = "在旅馆和城市中显示增益提醒。"
L["Show While Mounted"] = "骑乘时显示"
L["Show buff reminders while mounted."] = "在骑乘时显示增益提醒。"
L["When buff reminders appear or disappear, the remaining icons smoothly slide to re-center instead of snapping instantly. Disable for instant repositioning."] = "当增益提醒出现或消失时，剩余的图标平滑滑动以重新居中，而非瞬时跳位。禁用可瞬时重新定位。"
L["Click to Cast (Out of Combat)"] = "点击施放（仅限非战斗）"
L["Makes reminder icons clickable — left-click casts the missing buff. Blizzard restricts addon casting to secure buttons that cannot be moved, shown, or hidden during combat, so clicking only works out of combat — in combat, reminders are visual-only and clicks pass through as normal."] = "使提醒图标可以点击——左键点击即可施放缺失的增益。暴雪规定插件只能通过安全按钮施放法术，而安全按钮在战斗中无法移动、显示或隐藏，因此点击仅在非战斗状态下有效——战斗中提醒仅作视觉显示，点击会照常穿透。"
L["Sound to play when a buff reminder first appears. Individual spells can override this in the Spells tab."] = "增益提醒首次出现时播放的声音。各个法术可在“法术”选项卡中覆盖此项。"
L["Position"] = "位置"
L["Horizontal offset of buff reminder icons relative to the HUD. The range adjusts to your screen resolution."] = "增益提醒图标相对于 HUD 的水平偏移。范围会根据你的屏幕分辨率进行调整。"
L["Vertical offset of buff reminder icons relative to the HUD. The range adjusts to your screen resolution."] = "增益提醒图标相对于 HUD 的垂直偏移。范围会根据你的屏幕分辨率进行调整。"
L["Toggle a sample buff reminder icon so you can see your settings in action."] = "切换一个示例增益提醒图标，以便你查看设置的实际效果。"
L["Default"] = "默认"
L["Sound to play when the ready glow activates on any ability. Per-spell overrides below take priority."] = "当任何技能上的就绪辉光激活时播放的声音。下方各个法术的覆盖项优先。"
L["Primary"] = "主要"
L["Secondary"] = "次要"
L["Utility"] = "辅助"
L["Auxiliary"] = "附加"
